OL,3,AIoan Gruffudd in AI warning after fan
OL,4,Aclaimed they had been in year-long
OL,5,Aaffair
OL,6,
OL,7,FHollywood actor Ioan Gruffudd has
OL,8,Fwarned fans of "explicit and
OL,9,Fdisturbing" AI-generated content
OL,10,Fimpersonating him online.
OL,12,FThe 53-year-old star, from near
OL,13,FAberdare, Rhondda Cynon Taf, urged his
OL,14,Ffollowers not to send money to people
OL,15,Fusing images and videos of his
OL,16,Flikeness, after the content was brought
OL,17,Fto his attention.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,170,160,200,105,0,100
