OL,3,AIoan Gruffudd in AI warning after fan
OL,4,Aclaimed they had been in year-long
OL,5,Aaffair
OL,6,
OL,7,F"A woman came to a convention I was
OL,8,Frecently attending and she was under
OL,9,Fthe impression that she was in an
OL,10,Fextramarital relationship with me for
OL,11,Fover a year," he said in an Instagram
OL,12,Fpost.
OL,14,F"She showed me hundreds of AI images
OL,15,Fand videos that someone claiming to be
OL,16,Fme had sent to her. The images were
OL,17,Fexplicit and disturbing."
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
